[Submission_1.Objectives]
Hold out until reinforcements arrive. Destroy as many enemy units as possible.
[Submission_1.Description]

Your orders are:
- 	Hold out until reinforcements arrive. 
- 	Destroy as many enemy units as possible. 
[Submission_1.Success]
Reinforcements have arrived!
[Submission_1.Failed]
Defeat. You were unable to hold out long enough.
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Hold your position.
[Submission_2.Description]
The Ponyri terminal is a focal point in our defense on the northern face of the Kursk Salient. Realizing it, the German command has deployed some of its heaviest armor and self-propelled artillery units to this sector. 

Your orders:
- 	Hold your positions at the Ponyri terminal. 
[Submission_2.Success]
Good job commander. You have held out against overwhelming odds.
[Submission_2.Failed]
You have failed the Motherland! Your troops have been destroyed.
[Mission.Objectives]
Stop the German advance. 
[Mission.Description]
All along the northern side of the Kursk Salient, German units have been fighting hard near the Ponyri terminal. 

Your orders: 
- 	Prevent a breakthrough of our front lines near the terminal. 
[Mission.Success]
Your orders were successful. Germans failed to break through the front line. 
[Mission.Failed]
You have failed to prevent the Germans from breaking through. They are now advancing directly on Kursk.
[StringTable.T34_Income]
Reinforcements have arrived.
[StringTable.SPG_reserv]
Reinforcements have arrived. 
[StringTable.Inf_reserv]
Infantry from the reserve is now at your disposal.